I am guessing that you need to set the executable permission on the executable.  Deploying an application doesn't automatically set the permissions for you.

You would need to do something like:

Sys.chmod() to make it executable.

It would be helpful for me to understand what you are trying to do here, since shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> is meant to be a platform for running shiny applications and not a general purpose execution platform in the cloud, for which there are much better solutions out there.  :)

