Hi all,

We have been working on putting together a user guide <http://docs.rstudio.com/shinyapps.io/> for shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> that we hope you will find useful, both in familiarizing yourself with shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> as well as in troubleshooting and looking for answers to common questions.

We appreciate any feedback you might have and look forward to fully launching the guide <http://docs.rstudio.com/shinyapps.io/> very soon.

http://docs.rstudio.com/shinyapps.io/

