Hi Tareef,

Thanks for sending the user guide along. I think its a very useful document. I reviewed the chapter and really like how the two steps authentication works at a deeper level in shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io>.

However, my question is more on how we can use the authentication process within shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> to allow each user to view information relevant to them only in each of the tabs within the app, based on their login information.

I am unable to find any example or resources that might help me incorporate this functionality within the  shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io>

Would really appreciate your help with this.

Thanks much!

